OL,3,A'No place for violence,' Macron says,
OL,4,Aas protesters clash with police in
OL,5,Acities across France
OL,6,
OL,7,FThere is "no place for violence",
OL,8,FFrench President Emmanuel Macron says,
OL,9,Fas protesters clash with police across
OL,10,FFrance over falling education standards
OL,11,Fand the cost of living
OL,13,FAbout 550,000 people have taken part in
OL,14,Fthe protests, according to Interior
OL,15,FMinister Laurent Nunez
OL,17,FNunez also says about 400 people have
OL,18,Fbeen arrested and 60 law enforcement
OL,19,Fofficers injured, including two who
OL,20,Fwere taken to hospital unconscious
OL,23,APub: 17-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
