OL,3,A'No place for violence,' Macron says,
OL,4,Aas protesters clash with police in
OL,5,Acities across France
OL,6,
OL,7,FA tourism office has been set on fire
OL,8,Fin Lyon, while protesters have broken
OL,9,Finto and damaged town hall buildings in
OL,10,FLille and Marseille
OL,12,FIt follows three weeks of student-led
OL,13,Fprotests across the country, with calls
OL,14,Ffor workers' unions and key figures
OL,15,Ffrom the "yellow vest" movement to join
OL,16,Fthe students
